      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 16:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:23 I passed through the square; from about 18:30 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:03 I passed through the square; around 22:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:05 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 08:00 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
