       "K0086"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7, from about 16:15 I was at home; at the Grey Heron from about 19:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 8 at the mill from about 07:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 9611,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
