       "K0112",
       "K0113"
      ],
      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 20:00 to 22:00 on Day 7, I saw Agnes, Anton, Bruno, Emil, Margaret, Ruth and Tomas, coming and going; Agnes, Emil and Margaret were the worse for drink.",
      "time": 9839,
      "topics": [
       "window"
      ]
     },
