      "key": "K0162",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:18 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 18:16 I passed through the square; around 18:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:30 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 9611,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "anton"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0163",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Agnes told me Anton owes them 43 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
