      "in": "K0186",
      "key": "K0187",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 16:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:13 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:16 I passed through the square; around 22:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 08:00 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 9611,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0188",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Tomas told me there's bad blood between Anton and Ruth \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
