      "key": "K0262",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 16:15 to 16:15 I was at home; around 16:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:24 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 23:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 23:13 I passed through the square; around 23:19 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:30 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 9611,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0263",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Anton and I have never got on \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "margaret"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0264",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me Margaret owes them 64 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
